---
import ServiceLayout from '../../layouts/ServiceLayout.astro';
---

<ServiceLayout
  number="03"
  tag="web_apps/"
  title="Web & App Development"
  headline="Purpose-built web apps that do exactly what you need."
  description="Emphasis on clean architecture, performance, and code your team can maintain."
>

  <section class="service-section" aria-labelledby="includes-heading">
    <p class="section-label" id="includes-heading">// What's included</p>
    <ul class="service-deliverables">
      <li>Full-stack web application development</li>
      <li>API design and integration</li>
      <li>Internal tools and dashboards</li>
      <li>Performance optimization</li>
      <li>Deployment and hosting setup</li>
      <li>Developer documentation and handoff</li>
      <li>Post-launch support window</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="service-section" aria-labelledby="engagement-heading">
    <p class="section-label" id="engagement-heading">// Typical engagement</p>
    <p class="service-engagement">
      I start with a clear spec, build with tight iteration loops for quality, and stay available after launch.
      Timelines depend on scope — I focus on getting it right, not getting it fast.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="service-section" aria-labelledby="tech-heading">
    <p class="section-label" id="tech-heading">// Technologies</p>
    <div class="service-chips">
      <span class="tech-chip">React</span>
      <span class="tech-chip">Next.js</span>
      <span class="tech-chip">Astro</span>
      <span class="tech-chip">Node.js</span>
      <span class="tech-chip">TypeScript</span>
      <span class="tech-chip">PostgreSQL</span>
      <span class="tech-chip">Prisma</span>
      <span class="tech-chip">Vercel</span>
      <span class="tech-chip">Fly.io</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="service-section" aria-labelledby="usecases-heading">
    <p class="section-label" id="usecases-heading">// Common use cases</p>
    <div class="use-cases-grid">
      <div class="use-case-card">
        <p class="use-case-card__title">Customer-facing SaaS feature build</p>
        <p>Add a major feature to your product — designed well, tested, and handed off cleanly.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="use-case-card">
        <p class="use-case-card__title">Internal ops dashboard</p>
        <p>A purpose-built tool your team actually uses — no bloated off-the-shelf software.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="use-case-card">
        <p class="use-case-card__title">Marketing or landing page sites</p>
        <p>Fast, SEO-ready marketing sites that convert — built with Astro or Next.js.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</ServiceLayout>
